# Test determines: key extraction from class declaration.
# The parser should extract [[[a b] c]] from determines: and populate ClassDecl.determines.
# This test verifies the parser handles the key correctly without error.

[
  TripleClass: [class [Triple a b c] [determines: [[[a b] c]]]
    combine: [Fn@c [a b c]]]

  result: 42
]

---

%.result
=== out
Int(42)
